# 1. CORE BUSINESS MODEL

Servexa will operate using a centralized pricing and commission management model.

There will be three primary participants:

1. Admin
2. Technician
3. Customer

The Admin controls the platform-wide business rules, service pricing policies, commission percentages, payment rules, withdrawal policies, and other financial settings.

Technicians can customize their service prices only within the limits and permissions established by Admin.

Customers can view transparent service prices, additional charges, technician prices, and estimated total costs before confirming a booking.

The system must automatically calculate:

- Total service amount
- Visiting fee
- Additional charges
- Applicable discounts
- Commissionable amount
- Servexa platform commission
- Technician earnings
- Pending earnings
- Available earnings
- Reserved balance
- Withdrawable balance
- Cash deposit dues
- Withdrawal amounts

All calculations must be performed and validated on the backend.

Never trust prices, commissions, balances, or payment statuses submitted directly by the frontend.

